# Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and fill in the values for your environment.
# Everything here is read on the server only; nothing is inlined into the
# browser bundle. Never commit a real token.

# Where homepage content comes from:
#   strapi  - query the live CMS at STRAPI_URL (default)
#   fixture - render the bundled sample content in lib/cms/fixtures.ts,
#             so the app builds and boots with no CMS running
CMS_SOURCE=fixture

# GraphQL endpoint of the Strapi CMS backend.
STRAPI_URL=http://localhost:1337/graphql

# Origin of the Strapi CMS. Its hostname is added to `images.domains` so that
# next/image may load media uploaded to the CMS, and it is prefixed onto the
# root-relative media URLs Strapi's local upload provider returns.
STRAPI_CMS_URL=http://localhost:1337

# Optional Strapi API token, if the GraphQL endpoint is not public.
# Server-side only. Use a real token in `.env`, never in this file.
# STRAPI_TOKEN=replace-me-with-a-strapi-api-token

# Optional: seconds between ISR regenerations of the homepage (default 60).
# CMS_REVALIDATE_SECONDS=60
